# Scope

Five test/harness files changed; no product module, live configuration, credentials or session was changed. No commit created.

- tests/test_side_wake_protocol.py
- tests/test_side_notice_claim.py
- tests/test_side_operator_redaction.py
- tests/test_side_external_parity.py
- tests/side_real_backend_harness.mjs

# Confirmed root cause

Commit 26881a2 (2026-11-18) changed side_work_decision.apply to request a handoff only for action=advise (when not a main reply). A gated action=update no longer requests main action or a review. The old Board, Session, LeakSession and JS decided() fixtures still emitted gated updates and then tested handoffs, wake elections or reviews which the fixture never created.

The original unit log at C:/Users/djlov/AppData/Local/Temp/group_unit.txt contains 31 error entries and 13 failure entries in the eight verified side test files (subTest failures count separately). Examples: requested side handoff required; side_handoffs missing; unknown side review; JS wake arrays empty or barriers timing out.

# Repair and preserved semantics

- Board uses its existing kind argument (default advise) and asserts that fixture resolution requested a handoff.
- Session and LeakSession use advise for unreleased-gate fixtures. release=True still uses update with exact release_waits, and Session asserts that a released wait requires no handoff.
- JS decided() uses advise without incompatible kind=request. The time-limit case remains an advice event carrying the same time_limit.
- Two fixture-dependent skips became requested-handoff assertions. No new skip added.
- Advice question is intentionally public: side_work_decision.py assigns decision.reply to handoff.question; WorkHttpController._side_projection includes question. Redaction tests now assert this exact public question, forbid a separate reply field, and scan the remainder for the original, credential, private reply, generation, tokens, owner nonces and attempts.
- All existing election, fencing, durable write, old-reader, prompt lease, notice retry, REST parity and wake-secret assertions remain active.

# Verification

Every test process unsets inherited CIEL_RUNTIME_* variables and sets CIEL_RUNTIME_TEST_ISOLATED=1 and a fresh temporary CIEL_RUNTIME_CONFIG_DIR. Tests run by file with repository/tests first on sys.path to avoid the installed unrelated tests package.

